  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/iffaTEHUTnFGM_mNF9aLyYWmU-JddqJhEsdZzPm3aIs.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\n\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{H}=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{v}_0}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)^2}{2 \\mathrm{~g}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{v}_0^2}{4 \\mathrm{~g}} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~L}=\\mathrm{mvh} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~L}=\\mathrm{m} \\frac{\\mathrm{v}_0}{\\sqrt{2}} \\frac{\\mathrm{v}_0^2}{4 \\mathrm{~g}}\n\\end{aligned}$",
